<title>GERMANY: MG sees rise in 96/97 return on capital.</title>
<headline>MG sees rise in 96/97 return on capital.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metallgesellschaft AG, the diversified engineering and trading group rescued from the brink of bankruptcy in 1994, said on Thursday it aimed to increase its return on capital to 12 percent in its current 1996/1997 business year from nine percent in 1995/1996.</p>
<p>The company's business year runs to September 30. MG said</p>
